{"code":0,"data":{"title":"付费下载游戏提交流程","content":"<h1 id=\"s-k35lq3g0\"></h1><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20230825/q04tq8/20230825172236752891.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"820\" height=\"248\" data-natural-width=\"852\" data-natural-height=\"258\" data-type=\"image\"></p><h1 id=\"s-flerqlfj\">一、评测流程</h1><h2 id=\"s-ud1xgvlq\">1、创建游戏，选择游戏类型，填写基本信息</h2><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20221121/9kdtmw/20221121101355208483.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-natural-width=\"1652\" data-natural-height=\"191\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20221121/kyd6bl/20221121101526261620.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-natural-width=\"1665\" data-natural-height=\"333\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p>选择“单机”“普通联运”</p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-beixhesn\">2、提交评测</h2><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20230801/5p0sl6/20230801165304513263.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"246\" data-natural-width=\"999\" data-natural-height=\"289\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20221121/rk028s/20221121101922720790.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-natural-width=\"1250\" data-natural-height=\"748\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p>创建游戏完成后，可选择发起新游评测，后台提交后10个工作日内返回结果，在此期间，<strong>游戏预约可同步进行</strong></p><p><br></p><h1 id=\"s-attdn1cp\">二、预约流程</h1><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20221121/kce4xg/20221121100605641976.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"175\" data-natural-width=\"732\" data-natural-height=\"220\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20221121/z3v56b/20221121103518753944.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-natural-width=\"1248\" data-natural-height=\"520\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p>预约申请通过后，即可上传预约素材，3-5个工作日审核完毕</p><p><br></p><h1 id=\"s-vxgx5w5u\">三、游戏首发流程</h1><h2 id=\"s-8rhlawpn\">1、价格设置&amp;测试</h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20230908/1mjkny/20230908114401284592.png\" data-natural-width=\"1868\" data-natural-height=\"314\" data-type=\"image\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20230908/lyik34/20230908142055167998.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"151\" data-natural-width=\"820\" data-natural-height=\"177\" data-type=\"image\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(243, 57, 28)\">（1）选择“</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(243, 57, 28)\">删档计费测试</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(243, 57, 28)\">”（不外显，仅内部调试）并通过邮件的形式告诉商务付费价格，内部进行价格配置，详情请与商务联系，联系方式：QQ 3002270081</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(243, 57, 28)\">（2）为避免因账号限制，强制新手引导等问题影响，请在备注内提供跳过新手引导的测试账号；</span></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-t5tf9to6\">2、提交首发审核</h2><h2 id=\"s-p9s7wh2c\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20230908/aag6y3/20230908115342997828.png\" data-natural-width=\"1868\" data-natural-height=\"304\" data-type=\"image\"></h2><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20230908/2lj8xw/20230908115501406205.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"154\" data-natural-width=\"860\" data-natural-height=\"189\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p>价格配置完毕后，可在首页“<strong>重新提交</strong>”，进入首发设置页面，提交正式首发包体</p><p><br></p><h1 id=\"s-bq29xtuu\">四、其他</h1><p>1、若进入游戏有限制，为避免影响审核结果，<span style=\"color: rgb(243, 57, 28)\">请将vivo测试IP地址添加至白名单</span>，方便平台审核人员进入。</p><p>当前测试IP为：</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(243, 57, 28)\">122.96.92.230（必须添加）</span></strong></p><p>121.12.163.210</p><p>120.197.202.83</p><p>120.86.121.114</p><p>58.253.97.19</p><p>183.237.222.146</p><p>121.12.149.106</p><p>120.86.121.116</p><p>120.86.121.115</p><p>120.197.173.99</p><p>120.197.173.130</p><p>120.80.57.11</p><p>183.238.135.118</p><p><br></p><p>2、上架后，如需要举办优惠活动，可以在开放平台官网右手边<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://bps.vivo.com.cn/work\">工单系统</a>申请修改游戏价格， 1-2个工作日会进行处理，如有疑问可直接联系商务。</p><p><br></p>","versionCode":5,"updateTime":1694154166000,"breadCrumbs":"游戏管理,游戏上传须知,付费下载游戏提交指南","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}